+# Group 1: key="apple", values=["apple", "Apple"]
+# Group 2: key="banana", values=["banana"]
+
+# This seems to work for grouping.
+# But what about "retaining the spelling of the first encountered key"?
+# The key in the groupby result will be the result of the key function, which is "apple".
+# We want the key to be "apple" (the first one encountered).
+
